# Only the loop state the perf-iteration skill lists (its <loop_state>): the
# ledger, the scoreboard, run records and report files, the A/B reports they
# point to, tools/ and patches/. Built pages, images, charts, traces and raw
# JSON stay in bench/out/. (The earliest runs' A/B reports, named otherwise,
# are tracked already.)
/*
!/.gitignore
!/LEDGER.md
!/RUN-*.md
!/ab-*.md
!/scoreboard.jsonl
!/RUN-*.report.json
!/tools/
!/patches/
